  "prefLabel": "He-W 637.18 Interim Activities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 637.18 Interim Activities. New Hampshire employment program (NHEP) participants shall be required to participate in the specific interim activities, including the allowable federal activities pursuant to 45 CFR 261.30, identified in the NHEP participant’s employability plan as defined in He-W 637.01.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading He-W 600) #6446, eff 2-1-97; amd by #7192, eff 2-1-00; amd by #8269, eff 2-1-05; ss by #8740, INTERIM, eff 10-13-06, EXPIRED: 4-11-07\n\nNew. #8869, eff 4-19-07; ss by #10803, eff 3-26-15; ss by #14131, eff 11-26-24, EXPIRES: 11-26-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w600.html"
